# The markdown documents and the phase test files are deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# PROTOCOL.md is the wire specification, LEARNING-LOG.md is the design record, and the
# PHASE-n files are the write-ups. Phase 10 requires them to be linked from the README, so
# a fresh clone has to contain them. Ignoring a test file is worse still: it makes a clone
# quietly run fewer tests than the machine it was written on. See PHASE-7-REPORT.md, B7.
01-java-chat-application-build-guide.md
